---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Base title="About" description="About Amit Brahmbhatt — software engineering leader and technical founder.">
  <section>
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
      I'm Amit Brahmbhatt, a software engineering leader and technical founder
      working across AI systems, cybersecurity, and high-performance computing.
    </p>
    <p>
      My work runs from CUDA C++ performance engineering on an RTX 5090, through
      post-quantum authorization and falsification-first AI adjudication, to
      quantum communication protocols and benchmarks run against real hardware.
      Thirty-six public repositories across two GitHub accounts trace the
      throughline: measure first, trust evidence over intuition, and publish the
      null results too.
    </p>
    <p>
      On the venture side, I'm building HexaGrid — AI-infrastructure cost
      optimization, taking it into paid enterprise design partners. I'm based
      in {site.location}.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Collaborate</h2>
    <p class="area-blurb">
      I collaborate on hard technical problems — open source, research, or
      venture — especially in AI infrastructure, security, and quantum systems.
    </p>
    <p>
      <span class="prompt">$</span> The fastest way to reach me is through
      {site.socials.map((s, i) => (
        <><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{s.label}</a>{i < site.socials.length - 1 ? " · " : ""}</>
      ))}.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
